      "claim_class": "formula_and_assumptions",
      "claim_id": "formula-and-assumptions",
      "claim_quote": "S2 is a label-free alternative construction built from frozen C2 component estimates, not an accuracy estimate. It applies two explicit, unverified assumptions: a Microsoft-sourced Overture building record is treated as exact overlap with the removed Microsoft reference, and a zero Overture fire/EMS/school category count is treated as a zero USGS reference count for dropping that facility type from the POI facilities half. The building component is multiplied by one minus the per-tract source share; missing shares leave C2 unchanged. The transport component remains unchanged from C2. The POI facilities half is the arithmetic mean of retained defined facility types; the establishment half is the unchanged feature-only CBP proxy; POI is the mean of whichever halves are defined. The final score is the mean of whichever transport, building, and POI components are defined. There are no fitted coefficients and no S-style shrinkage is stacked on top.",
